<https://w3id.org/rtskg/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The RTSKG ontology is the unified schema of the Rail Transit Station Knowledge Graph (RTSKG), a dataset that explicitly models the spatial and semantic interactions among different kinds of urban entities. It defines ten classes and nineteen relations."@en .
